Package: @PACKAGE_ID@
Name: kk
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: A coding agent that uses the subscription you have
 Ask for a change in plain language and kk reads your files, writes the code and
 runs the commands to make it happen. Run `kk` in a terminal, then `/login` to
 sign in with Anthropic, ChatGPT, Copilot, Cursor, Kimi, Grok, Z.AI or
 OpenRouter — or use an API key for any OpenAI-compatible service. It is a
 native binary, so it starts fast and pulls in no Node or Bun. Also installed
 as `kwwk`.
